Using Lemmas~\ref{l:e-stationary} and \ref{l:weakcvx}, we obtain
\begin{align*}
&\min_{1\leq j\leq k}(\dist(-\nabla_yH(\bar{x}^j,\bar{y}^j),A^*\partial g(\prox_{\mu_j g}(A\bar{y}^j))+\dist(0,G_{\sigma_j}(\bar{x}^j,\bar{y}^j))) \\
